  "purpose": "Structured JSON database describing the Real Estate ERP navigation macro-areas and their domain subareas/facets. This artifact is intended for generators, CRUD navigation, HTML composition and later persistence. It is not a physical schema, ontology tree, or canonical Domain Pack.",
  "rules": [
    "Macro-areas are UX/navigation groupings.",
    "Subareas are domain facets.",
    "A term may belong to multiple subareas.",
    "Subareas do not define physical tables.",
    "Subareas do not determine package ownership.",
    "Regional terminology must be applied later through mappings, aliases, jurisdiction metadata or extensions."
